			],
			"Message": "refactor(Grove): Standardize imports and format dev_log statements\n\nAlign the Grove codebase with project-wide style conventions by consolidating multi-line imports and reformating `dev_log!` macro invocations across the runtime, host, transport, and WASM subsystems.\n\n- Unify `use` statements to group crate-relative imports (e.g., `crate::dev_log`) with local modules, removing redundant single-line imports scattered throughout the code.\n- Reformat `dev_log!` calls to wrap arguments across multiple lines where necessary for readability, ensuring consistent indentation and brace placement in `Source/DevLog.rs`, `Source/Host/*`, `Source/Transport/*`, and `Source/WASM/*`.\n- Add explicit Common library telemetry initialization in `Source/main.rs` to enable the dual-pipe PostHog/OTLP collector in debug builds.\n- Update `CHANGELOG.md`, `README.md`, and `Cargo.toml` to reflect the completed migration and the addition of the Common dependency.\n\nThese changes improve code consistency and maintainability without altering functional behavior or API contracts.",
			"SHA": "2c68c2164cf9766afceb1d87e7842eb54f1ac827"
		},
